# Hospital Management System

## 📌 Project Overview
This project is a Hospital Management System built using Python, Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), and SQLite database.

## 🏥 Modules
- Patient Registration
- Doctor Details
- Appointment Booking
- Admit/Discharge
- Bill Generation
- Search Patient

## 🧑‍💻 OOP Concepts
- Patient class
- Doctor class
- Appointment class

## 🗄️ Database Tables
- patients
- doctors
- appointments

